  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FZHXFYp8fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/878718567078559754?color=blueviolet&amp;label=Discord\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p><p>感謝 Huetete#3721 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XICnsFb.png\" alt=\"名稱\"> &nbsp;感謝 Arizaniac 提供音樂光碟與錄音機材質，以及 Huetete 提供新標誌與 GUI 圖示！</p><p><strong>自 V7 版本起，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-impossible-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Impossible Library</a> 為唯一必要依賴項</strong></p><p>此模組可讓您根據遊戲內觸發條件播放音樂。</p><p>如何使用？</p><ul>\n<li>執行遊戲一次以生成所有必要的設定檔與資料夾</li>\n<li>所有音樂檔案需放置於 config/MusicTriggers/songs 路徑下（除非各音頻頻道另有設定）</li>\n<li>詳盡說明請參閱 Wiki 文件。</li>\n</ul><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fmusictriggers%252fdocs%252ftriggers%252fpriority_defaults\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">現有觸發條件及其預設優先級列表</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>模組相容性</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atomicstrykers-infernal-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AtomicStryker's Infernal Mobs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-weather\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Weather</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bloodmoon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bloodmoon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/champions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Champions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-surroundings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Surroundings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-celestials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Celestials</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/game-stages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Game Stages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nyx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nyx</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serene Seasons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weather-storms-tornadoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weather2</a>\n&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p><strong><em>歡迎將本模組用於模組包、伺服器、影片等任何用途，惟需註明出處並連結回本頁或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmusic-triggers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 頁面</a>。禁止上傳至 9minecraft 等重新託管網站。</em></strong></p>",
